sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant Page as Nuxt page
  participant Route as Nuxt API route
  participant API as Rust server
  participant DB as Database
  User->>Page: Select level and submit
  Page->>Route: Send submission request
  Route->>API: Forward session-authenticated request
  API->>DB: Validate contest state and save submission
  DB-->>API: Submission ID and state
  API-->>Route: Submission status
  Route-->>Page: Return status
  Page->>Route: Poll submission status when processing
  Route->>API: Read submission state
  API->>DB: Load current status
  DB-->>API: Validation and publication status
  API-->>Page: Updated status
  Page-->>User: Show result or next action
